From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: omarchy-m5 <omarchy-m5@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:52:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] arm64: dts: apple: add the J714s (MacBook Pro 14-inch, M5
 Pro)

omarchy-m5 dt/t6050*.dtsi + dt/t6050-j714s.dts (as of omarchy-m5 63047c4),
generated from and checked against the J714s runtime ADT, with the
compatibles adapted to integration/aurora:

- MTP HID: apple,t6041-dockchannel-hid selects the ring transport
  (was apple,t8132-dockchannel-hid with our patch 0005).
- SPMI: apple,t8142-spmi gen 4 layout, polled; the AIC interrupt and
  interrupt-controller properties are dropped (the aurora driver refuses
  a gen 4 node with an interrupt); reg sized to the ADT's 0x4000.
- NVMe: apple,t8140-nvme-ans2 (was apple,t8132-nvme-ans2 with our 0006).
- SART: apple,t6050-sart only (SARTv4, aurora-port patch).
- AIC: apple,t6050-aic3 kept; an aurora-port patch matches it to the
  T8142 read-only VM_TMR_FIQ_ENA_EL2 handling.

Register the t6050-j714s.dtb.
